menu "hassctrl SD card"

    config HC_SDCARD
        bool "SD card"
        depends on HC_BOARD_HAS_SDCARD
        default y
        help
            The board's microSD slot (hc::board::Info::sd_*): FAT at /sd, mounted at boot, alarm
            sounds from /sd/sounds/alarms, mic recordings saved as WAV, the SD card page of the
            web UI (files, upload, download from a URL, rename/move, format), the file manager
            in Settings, System and the console command `sd`.
            Only boards with a slot offer it; without it none of the SD code is in the firmware.

endmenu
